00:19:39,040 --> 00:20:07,280
I think me and you are in the same boat where we assume that literally everything is happening to us and that we're not respon in that mode, I think that's actually healthy in the App Store in particular, because there are a lot of factors that can drive users towards you that, like, I know people who, you know, they work on their app all the time, they're always adding features, and they're attributing their growth to the features that they're adding.

254
00:20:08,000 --> 00:20:34,000
