00:22:48,560 --> 00:23:27,040
purchasing it like if you're on a production like the cost of a physical teleprompter granted they're gonna have to use this with other physical items but like yeah 17 dollars is like basically free in terms of a movie budget even a really low budget you know production yeah a lot of that was sort of me learning that and being confident enough to to you know put our pricing a little bit more along the lines of what we were actually offering and I'm just trying to think when we went subscription but that was that was quite a while after I went full time.

279
00:23:28,560 --> 00:23:34,480
So yeah, I think a lot of it was just that actually understanding our position in the market.

280
00:23:34,880 --> 00:23:47,280
And then, doing that, puts me in a position where I have a little bit more responsibility to create a product that's kind of robust and does the things that people need it to do.

